 30-second listen on\nthe wire.\n\nSupported protocols:\n- LLDP (universal: Aruba, HP, Juniper, Extreme, Cisco, MikroTik)\n- CDP (Cisco)\n- MNDP (MikroTik RouterOS fallback)\n\nShips a desktop GUI and a headless CLI in one binary. The CLI\ntakes `portfinder capture --interface <NIC> --protocol LLDP\n[--json]`. Requires Npcap (with \"Allow non-administrators to\ncapture\" enabled) for non-administrator capture.","moniker":"portfinder","name":"PortFinder","packageUrl":"https://packetthrower.github.io/PortFinder/","publisher":"packetThrower","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/packetThrower","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/packetThrower/PortFinder/releases/tag/v4.1.2","tags":["cdp","discovery","lldp","mndp","network","networking","npcap","packet-capture","pcap","switch","vlan"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/packetThrower","releaseDate":"2026-05-20","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/packetThrower/PortFinder/releases/tag/v4.1.2","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/p/packetThrower/PortFinder/4.1.2/packetThrower.PortFinder.yaml","sha256":"d9b476fbfc7e43ff471a921ee0bc76b16f55803b26ee9fc65dffa61b2be25310"},{"path":"manifests/p/packetThrower/PortFinder/4.1.2/packetThrower.PortFinder.installer.yaml","sha256":"a5bf0f62dd4658493cc3a456ca62bf3f4f7a682fe86bdc98665ffeac5f38792e"},{"path":"manifests/p/packetThrower/PortFinder/4.1.2/packetThrower.PortFinder.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"c5533e8bbe7b690737b32d86c4435d9ae7b1c947ccc61fa0c9a2d28b9e76fac9"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"4.1.2"}